, "s": 64.182, "e": 64.357, "p": 9}, {"w": "software.", "s": 64.426, "e": 64.949, "p": 9}, {"w": "Maybe", "s": 64.972, "e": 65.181, "p": 9}, {"w": "you", "s": 65.204, "e": 65.274, "p": 9}, {"w": "want", "s": 65.343, "e": 65.471, "p": 9}, {"w": "to", "s": 65.494, "e": 65.541, "p": 9}, {"w": "use", "s": 65.634, "e": 65.936, "p": 9}, {"w": "AI", "s": 65.994, "e": 66.319, "p": 9}, {"w": "to", "s": 66.388, "e": 66.446, "p": 9}, {"w": "make", "s": 66.516, "e": 66.679, "p": 9}, {"w": "your", "s": 66.713, "e": 66.83, "p": 9}, {"w": "business", "s": 66.864, "e": 67.224, "p": 9}, {"w": "easier", "s": 67.306, "e": 67.654, "p": 9}, {"w": "to", "s": 67.712, "e": 67.758, "p": 9}, {"w": "run.", "s": 67.816, "e": 68.501, "p": 9}, {"w": "Come", "s": 68.802, "e": 69.011, "p": 10}, {"w": "inside,", "s": 69.046, "e": 69.522, "p": 10}, {"w": "find", "s": 69.557, "e": 69.742, "p": 10}, {"w": "your", "s": 69.777, "e": 69.87, "p": 10}, {"w": "starting", "s": 69.905, "e": 70.149, "p": 10}, {"w": "point,", "s": 70.184, "e": 70.381, "p": 10}, {"w": "and", "s": 70.404, "e": 70.474, "p": 10}, {"w": "start", "s": 70.532, "e": 70.764, "p": 10}, {"w": "building.", "s": 70.822, "e": 71.449, "p": 10}], "paras": [{"s": 0.6, "e": 6.173, "text": "Trying to build a business with AI right now can feel like trying to put together a puzzle while somebody keeps adding new pieces."}, {"s": 6.473, "e": 13.717, "text": "You've got GoHighLevel, Claude, app builders, AI agents, automations, and a new tool everybody says you need every week."}, {"s": 14.017, "e": 22.562, "text": "There's a lot of opportunity. But figuring out what to use, how it all connects, and what someone would actually pay you for gets complicated fast."}, {"s": 22.862, "e": 24.766, "text": "That's why I built this community."}, {"s": 25.066, "e": 32.682, "text": "This is where I share my strategies, skills, tools, and training for starting and growing an online business using AI, SaaS, and GoHighLevel."}, {"s": 32.982, "e": 38.137, "text": "We cover how to build something useful, package it into an offer, deliver it, and get customers."}, {"s": 38.437, "e": 47.214, "text": "You'll get practical training, downloadable skills, prompts, and resources you can use in your own business. You'll also have coaching and a place to bring questions as you work through it."}, {"s": 47.514, "e": 54.109, "text": "And as things change, you'll get exclusive drops, new training, and updates on what I'm building and testing."}, {"s": 54.409, "e": 60.771, "text": "The idea is that you can come here, understand your options, and choose a next step that makes sense for where you are."}, {"s": 61.071, "e": 68.502, "text": "Maybe you're starting with an idea. Maybe you've already got an agency and want to add software. Maybe you want to use AI to make your business easier to run."}, {"s": 68.802, "e": 71.449, "text": "Come inside, find your starting point, and start building."}]}